o<go_to_g30> sub

M73
G90
; SPLIT, NOT A BARE G30 (operator 2026-08-11). A coordinated move runs at
; its SLOWEST axis: G30 carries A and C along, and MAX_ANGULAR_VELOCITY is
; 30 deg/s against 200 mm/s linear, so the long XY leg crawled at the
; angular rate. Separating them keeps the angular limit on the short leg.
; #5181/2/3 = the stored G30 point, machine coordinates.
G53 G0 Z0
G53 G0 X#5181 Y#5182
G53 G0 A0 C0
G53 G0 Z#5183

o<go_to_g30> endsub

M2
